flowchart LR
  URL[URL query string: filters, sort, page] --> TF[lib/ticketFilters]
  TF --> RQ[TanStack Query with keys t, tenantId, resource]
  RQ --> API[api/client.ts: Authorization, X-Correlation-Id, ApiError mapping]
  AC[AuthContext and tokenStore: memory plus sessionStorage] --> API
  API --> GW[Gateway :8080]
  RQ --> UI[Lazy route pages and UI kit]
  FRM[React Hook Form and Zod] --> MUT[Mutations]
  MUT --> API
  MUT -->|invalidate key prefix| RQ
  API -->|401: clear session| AC
  AC -->|logout: clear whole cache| RQ
